1795344259928	{"id":{"$t":"tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-8657703664257880060.post-7639493954993948679"},"published":{"$t":"2026-11-22T05:44:19.928-05:00"},"updated":{"$t":"2026-11-22T05:44:19.928-05:00"},"category":[{"scheme":"http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#","term":"Articles"},{"scheme":"http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#","term":"History"},{"scheme":"http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#","term":"lang-ne"},{"scheme":"http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#","term":"Nepali"},{"scheme":"http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#","term":"pair-sumer6"},{"scheme":"http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#","term":"series-sumer"}],"title":{"type":"text","$t":"अक्कडका सार्गन : पहिलो साम्राज्यको उदय"},"summary":{"type":"text","$t":"किशका एक पानसेवकले कसरी सुमेरको घमण्ड तोडे, मेसोपोटामियाको पहिलो साम्राज्य खडा गरे र तीन शताब्दी लामो खडेरीले त्यसलाई कसरी ढाल्यो। शताब्दीयौंसम्म मेसोपोटामियाको इतिहास दक्षिणका सुमेरियाली नगर–राज्यहरूको हातमा रह्यो—स्वाभिमानी, स्वतन्त्र र नहर, सिमाना अनि प्रतिष्ठाका लागि निरन्तर आपसमा जुधिरहने नगरहरू। तर सुमेरियाली महत्वाकांक्षा चरममा पुगेको बेला पनि, जब विजेता लुगल–जागे–सी (Lugal-zage-si) ले फारस"},"link":[{"rel":"replies","type":"application/atom+xml","href":"https://www.kafka.blog/feeds/7639493954993948679/comments/default","title":"Post Comments"},{"rel":"replies","type":"text/html","href":"https://www.kafka.blog/2026/11/akkadka-sargon-pahilo-samrajyako-udaya.html#comment-form","title":"0 Comments"},{"rel":"edit","type":"application/atom+xml","href":"https://www.blogger.com/feeds/8657703664257880060/posts/default/7639493954993948679"},{"rel":"self","type":"application/atom+xml","href":"https://www.blogger.com/feeds/8657703664257880060/posts/default/7639493954993948679"},{"rel":"alternate","type":"text/html","href":"https://www.kafka.blog/2026/11/akkadka-sargon-pahilo-samrajyako-udaya.html","title":"अक्कडका सार्गन : पहिलो साम्राज्यको उदय"}],"author":[{"name":{"$t":"Unknown"},"email":{"$t":"noreply@blogger.com"},"gd$image":{"rel":"http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail","width":